MapOverviewPage.tsx: SI conversion adopted
  - Added: import useUnits from '@/hooks/useUnits'
  - Added: import convertSpeedFromSI from '@/lib/unitConversion'
  - latest.speed (m/s SI alias from speed_mph projection) converted via
    convertSpeedFromSI for both currentSpeed metric card and history table
  - speed unit label tracks unitPrefs.speed (was hardcoded 'mph')
  - distance unit label tracks unitPrefs.distance (was hardcoded 'mi')
  - latest.odometer is always undefined per backend mappings
    (vehiclePositionMappings does not project odometer); preserved as
    graceful '—' fallback when not numeric
  - historyColumns useMemo dep list now includes speedUnit (primitive
    dep keeps reference stability)

NavigationRoutePage.tsx: SI conversion adopted + pre-existing legacy bug fixed
  - Removed: useSettings (replaced by useUnits)
  - Added: import useUnits from '@/hooks/useUnits'
  - Added: import convertSpeedFromSI, convertDistanceFromSI from '@/lib/unitConversion'
  - PRE-EXISTING BUG FIX: legacy code applied useSettings.convertDistance
    to s.miles_to_arrival, treating the meters value as miles and producing
    a 1609x inflated display (10000 m -> "10000 mi" or "16093 km" depending
    on unit pref). After fix: convertDistanceFromSI(meters, distanceUnit)
    yields correct "10 km" / "6.2 mi"
  - chartData: speed converted via convertSpeedFromSI (was raw m/s rendered
    with hardcoded 'mph' axis label); miles converted via convertDistanceFromSI
  - avgSpeed: aggregated in raw SI m/s, converted at the boundary
  - recentDestinations: distance pre-converted at memo time so destColumns
    can render row.distance directly without double-conversion
  - waypointColumns: convertDistanceFromSI applied to row.distance (which
    flows through buildWaypoints from latest.miles_to_arrival in raw meters)
  - All chart YAxis labels and Area legend names switched to {{unit}}
    interpolation via i18n V2 keys (chartSpeedV2, chartDistanceV2,
    legendSpeedV2, legendDistanceToArrivalV2)
  - "Distance to Arrival" replaces hardcoded "Miles to Arrival" since the
    label now reflects user pref

TemperatureImpactPage.tsx: SI conversion adopted + KM_PER_MILE inlined
  - Removed: useSettings, UNITS (replaced by useUnits + KM_PER_MILE constant)
  - Added: import useUnits from '@/hooks/useUnits'
  - Added: import convertTempFromSI from '@/lib/unitConversion'
  - Added: KM_PER_MILE = 1.609344 module-level const (precedent: Phase-43/0025
    FleetComparePage.whPerKmToDisplay — no convertEfficiencyFromSI helper)
  - convertTemp wrapped via useCallback delegating to convertTempFromSI
    (mathematically identical to legacy convertTemp; name-aware)
  - toDispEff wrapped via useCallback (Wh/km -> Wh/mi when isMiles)
  - effLabel derived inline from unitPrefs.distance (replaces useSettings.
    efficiencyUnit)
  - useState/useMemo import extended to useState/useMemo/useCallback

